[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m Find the largest possible real part of \[(75+117i)z+\frac{96+144i}{z}\]where $z$ is a complex number with $|z|=4$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m Remember to put your answer on its own line after "Answer:".
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m assistant
