[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m Let's define this real part as \(R(\theta)\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m \[
