[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m    = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(117\cos\theta + 75\sin\theta)) + \frac{96\cos\theta + 144\sin\theta}{4} + \frac{i(144\cos\theta - 96\sin\theta)}{4}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m    \[
