[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m 3. **Maximize the real part:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m    We need to maximize the expression \(324\cos\theta - 432\sin\theta\). This can be done by finding the maximum value of the expression \(324\cos\theta - 432\sin\theta\). The maximum value of \(a\cos\theta + b\sin\theta\) is \(\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}\). So, the maximum value of \(324\cos\theta - 432\sin\theta\) is \(\sqrt{324^2 + 432^2}\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m    \sqrt{324^2 + 432^2} = \sqrt{104976 + 186624} = \sqrt{291600} = 540
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m So, the largest possible real part of the expression is \(540\).
