[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m Let's represent \(z\) in polar form. Since \(|z| = 4\), we can write \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)\). Then \(\frac{1}{z} = \frac{1}{4}e^{-i\theta} = \frac{1}{4}(\cos \theta - i \sin \theta)\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m Now we can substitute \(z\) and \(\frac{1}{z}\) into the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m (75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = (75 + 117i)4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4}(\cos \theta - i \sin \theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m Simplifying the expression, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m = 4(75 + 117i)(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) + \frac{1}{4}(96 + 144i)(\cos \theta - i \sin \theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m = 4(75 \cos \theta + 75i \sin \theta + 117i \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta) + \frac{1}{4}(96 \cos \theta - 96i \sin \theta + 144i \cos \theta + 144 \sin \theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m = 4(75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta + i (75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta)) + \frac{1}{4}(96 \cos \theta + 144 \sin \theta + i (144 \cos \theta - 96 \sin \theta))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m = 4(75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta) + 4i (75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta) + \frac{1}{4}(96 \cos \theta + 144 \sin \theta) + \frac{i}{4}(144 \cos \theta - 96 \sin \theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=228462)[0m Combining the real and imaginary parts, we get:
